      "line": 386,
      "obj_id": "INV-MPY-8",
      "text": "Every bounded resource and variable-sized value MUST expose capacity, ownership, overflow, truncation, and backpressure behavior suitable for `no_std + alloc` targets."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "def_shape": "table",
        "doc_status": "",
        "has_verification": true,
        "normative_keywords": [
          "MUST"
        ],
        "title": "",
        "verified_by": "MPY-01 matrix schema and MPY-09 parity-claim audit."
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "invariant",
      "line": 387,
      "obj_id": "INV-MPY-9",
      "text": "Every LVGL introspection parity claim MUST name its MPY-I level, covered surface, inherited LPAR pin, and deterministic evidence; generic full-parity claims are forbidden."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "def_shape": "table",
        "doc_status": "",
        "has_verification": true,
        "normative_keywords": [
          "MUST",
          "MUST NOT"
        ],
        "title": "",
        "verified_by": "MPY-03/06 capability rejection tests and call-context instrumentation."
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "invariant",
      "line": 388,
      "obj_id": "INV-MPY-10",
      "text": "MPY v1 actor execution MUST remain native: Python may direct and compose actors but MUST NOT execute in draw, measurement, hit-test, or native propagation paths."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {},
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "nongoal",
      "line": 450,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:nongoal:1",
      "text": "Embedded Python rendering. MPY v1 does not call Python to draw pixels,"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {},
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "nongoal",
      "line": 452,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:nongoal:2",
      "text": "Raw LVGL ABI compatibility. MPY does not expose LVGL or Rust pointers,"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {},
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "nongoal",
      "line": 454,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:nongoal:3",
      "text": "Generic full-parity claim. MPY does not imply every LVGL widget or"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {},
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "nongoal",
      "line": 456,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:nongoal:4",
      "text": "Application framework policy. Navigation architecture, domain models,"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {},
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "nongoal",
      "line": 459,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:nongoal:5",
      "text": "Snapshot restoration. Runtime snapshots are diagnostic in v1; they are"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {},
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "nongoal",
      "line": 461,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:nongoal:6",
      "text": "Unbounded dynamic behavior. Targets are not required to provide"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {},
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "nongoal",
      "line": 463,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:nongoal:7",
      "text": "Immediate dual-core-first development. The protocol is dual-core-ready,"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-MPY-1"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 493,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:gate:493",
      "text": "`INV-MPY-1` ownership between the language-neutral runtime and the MicroPython adapter is accepted."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-MPY-2"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 494,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:gate:494",
      "text": "`INV-MPY-2` opaque generation-checked identity is accepted, with bit layout explicitly deferred to MPY-02."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-MPY-3"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 495,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:gate:495",
      "text": "`INV-MPY-3` establishes one descriptor catalog for creation and introspection."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-MPY-4"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 496,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:gate:496",
      "text": "`INV-MPY-4` accepts requested layout as director-owned and computed geometry as rlvgl-owned."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-MPY-5"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 497,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:gate:497",
      "text": "`INV-MPY-5` accepts queued VM-safe callbacks instead of synchronous Python event handlers."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-MPY-6"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 498,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:gate:498",
      "text": "`INV-MPY-6` accepts validated batches and post-dispatch callback mutations."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-MPY-7"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 499,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:gate:499",
      "text": "`INV-MPY-7` accepts one semantic protocol for in-process and dual-core profiles."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-MPY-8"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 500,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:gate:500",
      "text": "`INV-MPY-8` accepts explicit bounded-resource and ownership behavior."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-MPY-9"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 501,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:gate:501",
      "text": "`INV-MPY-9` accepts level-scoped introspection parity claims and the inherited LPAR pin."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-MPY-10"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 502,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:gate:502",
      "text": "`INV-MPY-10` accepts native-only actor execution for MPY v1."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-MPY-1",
          "INV-MPY-7"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 503,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:gate:503",
      "text": "The MPY-01 through MPY-09 phase map is accepted without weakening `INV-MPY-1` or `INV-MPY-7`."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-MPY-2",
          "INV-MPY-3",
          "INV-MPY-5"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 504,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md:gate:504",
      "text": "PCDN-MPY-001 through PCDN-MPY-006 are resolved or assigned to the named phase without weakening `INV-MPY-2`, `INV-MPY-3`, or `INV-MPY-5`."
    },
