      "doc": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "mpy",
      "kind": "rationale",
      "line": 540,
      "obj_id": "docs/concepts/MPY-00-CONCEPTS.md#0.1.0-rationale",
      "text": "The previous hardware-first sketch proved the binding and transport direction\nbut stopped at a fixed rectangle/text stack. MicroPython cannot orchestrate the\nfull UI from that surface. A discoverable, transport-independent runtime object\ncontract must precede additional Python wrappers so object identity, creation,\nproperties, layout, callbacks, and dual-core behavior do not diverge by widget\nor adapter."
    }
